   "text": "Well… the first baby from Sasha’s litter officially has a name 😂🤍\n\nThis little guy has been obsessed with Sarah, our co-owner, since day one. If he wasn’t trying to climb into her lap, he was finding his way onto her desk while she worked.\n\nAnd somehow, every single time, he kept ending up inside her coffee cup. ☕🐱\n\nAfter catching him in there more than once, we decided the name was basically choosing itself.\n\nMeet Cupsey. 🥹🤍\n\nWe thought it was cute, a little silly, and honestly perfect for him.\n\n1 kitten named… 4 more to go. 😂",
